ext":"ணொடு","tr":"ṇoṭu"}]},{"text":"நினைப்பா","tr":"niṉaippā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நினைப்","tr":"niṉaip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"}]},{"text":"கின்றே","tr":"kiṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கின்","tr":"kiṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"புனவன்","parts":[{"text":"புனவன்","lemma":"புனவன்","gloss":"the forest cultivator"}],"gloss":"the forest cultivator","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துடவை","parts":[{"text":"துடவை","lemma":"துடவை","gloss":"field/garden"}],"gloss":"field"},{"surface":"பொன்போல்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold"},{"text":"போல்","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like gold"},{"surface":"சிறுதினை","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"},{"text":"தினை","lemma":"தினை","gloss":"millet"}],"gloss":"small millet"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடியுண்","parts":[{"text":"கடி","lemma":"கடி","gloss":"protective offering"},{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"consuming"}],"gloss":"consuming the protective offering"},{"surface":"கடவுட்கு","parts":[{"text":"கடவுள்","lemma":"கடவுள்","gloss":"god"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to (dative)"}],"gloss":"to the god"},{"surface":"இட்ட","parts":[{"text":"இட்ட","lemma":"இடு","gloss":"offered"}],"gloss":"offered"},{"surface":"செழுங்குரல்","parts":[{"text":"செழுமை","lemma":"செழுமை","gloss":"abundant"},{"text":"குரல்","lemma":"குரல்","gloss":"ear of millet"}],"gloss":"abundant ear of millet"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அறியாது","parts":[{"text":"அறியாது","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"without knowing"}],"gloss":"without knowing"},{"surface":"உண்ட","parts":[{"text":"உண்ட","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"having eaten"}],"gloss":"having eaten"},{"surface":"மஞ்ஞை","parts":[{"text":"மஞ்ஞை","lemma":"மஞ்ஞை","gloss":"peacock"}],"gloss":"peacock"},{"surface":"ஆடுமகள்","parts":[{"text":"ஆடு","lemma":"ஆடு","gloss":"dance"},{"text":"மகள்","lemma":"மகள்","gloss":"woman"}],"gloss":"dancing woman"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெறியுறு","parts":[{"text":"வெறி","lemma":"வெறி","gloss":"frenzy/spirit-dance"},{"text":"உறு","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing frenzy"},{"surface":"வனப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"வனப்பு","lemma":"வனப்பு","gloss":"beauty"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"with (instrumental)"}],"gloss":"with beauty"},{"surface":"வெய்துற்று","parts":[{"text":"வெய்து","lemma":"வெய்து","gloss":"hotly/painfully"},{"text":"உற்று","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"having experienced"}],"gloss":"experiencing distress"},{"surface":"நடுங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"நடுங்கும்","lemma":"நடுங்கு","gloss":"trembles"}],"gloss":"trembles"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சூர்மலை","parts":[{"text":"சூர்","lemma":"சூர்","gloss":"fear/celestial spirit"},{"text":"மலை","lemma":"மலை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain of spirits"},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"he (masculine suffix)"}],"gloss":"lord of the land"},{"surface":"கேண்மை","parts":[{"text":"கேண்மை","lemma":"கேண்மை","gloss":"intimacy/friendship"}],"gloss":"intimacy"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீர்மலி","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water/tears"},{"text":"மலி","lemma":"மலி","gloss":"abundant"}],"gloss":"abundant with tears"},{"surface":"கண்ணொடு","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with (sociative)"}],"gloss":"with eyes"},{"surface":"நினைப்பு","parts":[{"text":"நினைப்பு","lemma":"நினைப்பு","gloss":"thought"}],"gloss":"thought"},{"surface":"ஆகின்றே","parts":[{"text":"ஆகின்றே","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"becomes"}],"gloss":"becomes indeed"}]}],"literal":"Forest cultivator's field's gold-like small millet's / protective offering-consuming god-to offered abundant ear of millet / without knowing having eaten a peacock, like a dancing girl / possessing frenzy with beauty suffering distress trembles / mountain of spirits lord of the land's intimacy / water-abundant with eyes becomes a thought indeed.","translation":"The intimacy of the lord of the mountain of spirits, where a peacock, having unknowingly eaten the abundant ear of gold-like small millet offered to the god who consumes protective offerings, trembles in distress like a beautiful dancing girl possessed by frenzy, is now remembered by me with eyes full of tears.","modern":"தினைப்புனத்தைக் காப்பவனுடைய வயலில் விளைந்த, பொன்னைப் போன்ற சிறிய தினையின், பலி ஏற்கும் கடவுளுக்குப் படைக்கப்பட்ட செழுமையான கதிரை, அறியாமல் தின்ற மயில் ஒன்று, வெறியாட்டு ஆடும் பெண்ணின் அழகோடு துன்பமுற்று நடுங்கும். அத்தகைய அச்சம் தரும் தெய்வங்கள் வாழும் மலைநாட்டினுடைய தலைவனின் நட்பு, நீர் நிறைந்த கண்களோடு என்னால் நினைக்கப்படுகின்றது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante about her secret love affair with the hero, who is the lord of the mountain. She compares her state to that of a peacock that unknowingly ate the sacred millet offered to the deity. The peacock, having consumed the offering meant for the god, trembles in fear and distress, resembling a dancing girl possessed by a spirit during a Veriyāṭṭu ritual. Similarly, the heroine, having tasted the forbidden joy of secret love, now trembles with anxiety and fear of discovery. This Kuriñci landscape image beautifully mirrors her internal state of distress and fear of her family finding out about her love.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.75],[1.75,2.14],[2.14,2.53],[2.53,3.3],[3.3,4.0],[4.0,4.4],[4.4,4.6],[4.6,4.9],[4.9,5.3],[5.3,5.88],[5.88,6.6],[6.6,7.1],[7.1,8.0],[8.0,8.4],[8.4,8.7],[8.7,9.2],[9.2,10.4],[10.4,10.6],[10.6,11.1],[11.1,11.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.87],[1.87,2.14],[2.14,2.8],[2.8,3.3],[3.3,4.3],[4.3,4.8],[4.8,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,5.9],[5.9,6.61],[6.61,7.5],[7.5,8.0],[8.0,9.0],[9.0,9.51],[9.51,9.9],[9.9,10.5],[10.5,11.8],[11.8,12.0],[12.0,12.8],[12.8,13.2]]},"sync":[[["புனவன்","the forest cultivator"]],[["துடவை","field"],["பொன்போல்","like gold"]],[["பொன்போல்","like g